          "className": "music-family-title",
          "allowHtml": true,
          "text": {
            "de": "Werde Teil unserer <span class=\"music-family-title-accent\">Musikfamilie</span>",
            "en": "Become part of our <span class=\"music-family-title-accent\">music family</span>",
            "fr": "Fais partie de notre <span class=\"music-family-title-accent\">famille musicale</span>",
            "ln": "Koma eteni ya <span class=\"music-family-title-accent\">libota ya miziki</span>",
            "it": "Entra a far parte della nostra <span class=\"music-family-title-accent\">famiglia musicale</span>",
            "tr": "<span class=\"music-family-title-accent\">Müzik ailemize</span> katıl",
            "uk": "Стань частиною нашої <span class=\"music-family-title-accent\">музичної родини</span>"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "homepage-music-family-intro": {
      "file": "index.html",
      "indentSpaces": 12,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "className": "music-family-desc",
          "text": {
            "de": "Wer Freude daran hat, gemeinsam Musik zu machen, ist bei uns herzlich willkommen. Im CMI geht es um Offenheit, gegenseitige Unterstützung und die gemeinsame Liebe zur Musik.",
            "en": "Anyone who enjoys making music together is warmly welcome here. At CMI, openness, mutual support, and a shared love of music are at the heart of what we do.",
            "fr": "Toutes les personnes qui aiment faire de la musique ensemble sont les bienvenues chez nous. Au CMI, l'ouverture, le soutien mutuel et l'amour partage de la musique sont essentiels.",
            "ln": "Moto nyonso oyo asepelaka kosala miziki elongo azali boyei malamu kati na biso. Na CMI, polele, lisungi ya moko na moko mpe bolingo ya miziki ezali ya ntina mingi.",
            "it": "Chi ama fare musica insieme è il benvenuto tra noi. Nel CMI contano l'apertura, il sostegno reciproco e l'amore condiviso per la musica.",
            "tr": "Birlikte müzik yapmayı seven herkesi aramızda görmekten mutluluk duyarız. CMI'de açıklık, karşılıklı destek ve müziğe duyduğumuz ortak sevgi her şeyin merkezinde yer alır.",
            "uk": "У нас щиро вітають кожного, хто любить музикувати разом. Для КМІ головними є відкритість, взаємна підтримка та спільна любов до музики."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "homepage-music-family-highlights": {
      "file": "index.html",
      "indentSpaces": 8,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "tagName": "div",
          "className": "music-family-highlights",
          "allowHtml": true,
          "text": {
            "de": [
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Zeit füreinander</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Samstagvormittags treffen wir uns in Ochsenfurt zum Proben und für Zeit miteinander.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Ehrenamtlich getragen</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Unser gemeinsames Musizieren lebt vom Ehrenamt und ist derzeit ohne Gebühren möglich.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Offen für viele Wege</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Bei uns ist Platz für unterschiedliche Instrumente, Altersgruppen und musikalische Erfahrungen.</p>",
              "</article>"
            ],
            "en": [
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Time together</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>On Saturday mornings we meet in Ochsenfurt to rehearse and spend time together.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Powered by volunteers</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Our music-making is powered by volunteers and currently has no participation fee.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Open to many musical paths</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>There is room here for different instruments, ages, and musical backgrounds.</p>",
              "</article>"
            ],
            "fr": [
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Du temps les uns pour les autres</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Le samedi matin, nous nous retrouvons a Ochsenfurt pour repeter et passer du temps ensemble.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Porte par le benevolat</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Notre pratique musicale commune vit du benevolat et ne demande actuellement aucun frais de participation.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Ouvert a de nombreux parcours</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Il y a ici de la place pour differents instruments, ages et experiences musicales.</p>",
              "</article>"
            ],
            "ln": [
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Ntango mpo na moko na moko</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Mokolo ya samedi na ntongo tokutanaka na Ochsenfurt mpo na repetition mpe mpo na kozala elongo.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Esimbami na mosala ya bolingi</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Kosala miziki na biso etongami likolo ya mosala ya bolingi, mpe sikoyo esengaka mbongo ya kokota te.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Esika mpo na bato ndenge na ndenge</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Awa ezali na esika mpo na bibetelo ndenge na ndenge, bileko nyonso mpe mayele ya miziki ndenge na ndenge.</p>",
              "</article>"
            ],
            "it": [
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Tempo per stare insieme</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Il sabato mattina ci incontriamo a Ochsenfurt per fare le prove e stare insieme.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Reso possibile dal volontariato</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>La nostra attività musicale si regge sul volontariato e al momento non prevede quote di partecipazione.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Aperti a percorsi diversi</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Nel CMI c'è spazio per strumenti, età ed esperienze musicali diverse.</p>",
              "</article>"
            ],
            "tr": [
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Birlikte vakit</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Cumartesi sabahları Ochsenfurt'ta prova yapmak ve birlikte vakit geçirmek için buluşuyoruz.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Gönüllü emekle sürüyor</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Birlikte müzik yapma yolculuğumuz gönüllü emekle sürüyor ve şu anda katılım ücreti alınmıyor.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Farklı geçmişlere açık</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Burada farklı enstrümanlara, yaş gruplarına ve müzik deneyimlerine yer var.</p>",
              "</article>"
            ],
            "uk": [
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Час одне для одного</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Щосуботи вранці ми зустрічаємося в Оксенфурті на репетицію і спільний час.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Тримаємося на волонтерах</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>Наше спільне музикування існує завдяки волонтерській праці і наразі не потребує внесків за участь.</p>",
              "</article>",
              "<article class='music-family-highlight-card'>",
              "  <h3 class='music-family-highlight-title'>Відкриті до різних шляхів</h3>",
              "  <p class='music-family-highlight-copy'>У нас є місце для різних інструментів, вікових груп і музичного досвіду.</p>",
              "</article>"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
